retrieve data.\n\n#### Findings\n- **Reachability:** All hosts except host_2 are reachable from host_1, with no packet loss observed.\n- **Latency Spikes:** Several hosts exhibit occasional high RTT values, which may point to network congestion, improper flow rules, or issues with the SDN controller.\n- **Configuration Error:** The inability to parse network configuration for host_1 to host_2 suggests a potential anomaly in the network setup or tool functionality.\n\n#### Next Steps\nFurther investigation is required to:\n1. Analyze the SDN controller's configuration and flow rules.\n2. Examine the network configuration of host_2 and its edge switch (switch_2).\n3. Check for congestion or misconfigurations in the central switch (switch_0) and edge switches.\n\nThis concludes the initial diagnostic report.", "generation_info": {"finish_reason": "stop", "logprobs": null}, "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": {"input_tokens": 4374, "output_tokens": 648, "total_tokens": 5022, "input_token_details": {"audio": 0, "cache_read": 3072}, "output_token_details": {"audio": 0, "reasoning": 0}}}
